# Oino Interlude canon (preserve)

When working on `oino-interlude`, `projects/oino-interlude/**`, related Studio craft, shots, storyboards, or prompts for this film, treat [`projects/oino-interlude/CANON.md`](projects/oino-interlude/CANON.md) as locked.

## Must preserve

- Protagonist is **Oino**, a young woman; modern Oino/Oeno lineage inheritor.
- Artistic adaptation only — no claim of one universal genealogy.
- Line: Dionysus → Staphylus → Rhoeo → Anius → Oino (+ descendants).
- Gift: transformation toward nourishment (music, memory, food, care, change).
- Connect to Dionysus without requiring a literal god character to explain the plot.
- Original monologue unchanged; young woman narrates great-great-grandfather's archive.
- Sister's call to dinner = emotional/mythic trigger; father's unfinished melody = main musical object.
- Great-great-grandfather: perceptive, loving, fallible, implicated watcher.
- Industrial eras: benefit + cost each; recurring human needs stay recognizable.
- Table = ordinary/intimate/sacred destination.
- Father reunion genuinely comforts Oino before her shadow (rewind/edit/control).
- Holy-fool action: allow father to leave while wanting him to stay.
- Ending by behaviour: return to sister, accept anger, follow sister's altered note.
- Final image: exact title card **One Of Gods Fools** and **December 10, 2026**.

## Must not

- Generic magical powers for Oino; Dionysus as only wine/party/chaos; Dionysus as tech villain.
- Oino's choice as “suffering must continue”; father as monster under a digital face.
- Sister as moral prop; literalize every Babel/Icarus/Orpheus/Inanna/Midas/Dionysus beat.
- Explain the Zone; sync every edit to every beat.
- Lose clarity of who is waiting, leaving, listening, choosing.

## Craft

Blender/X-sheet/cel craft-first; no diffusion primary path; human approve; no silent auto-smooth.
